    (b) under Patent Claims of such Contributor to make, use, sell, offer
        for sale, have made, import, and otherwise transfer either its
        Contributions or its Contributor Version.

2.2. Effective Date
    The licenses granted in Section 2.1 with respect to any Contribution
    become effective for each Contribution on the date the Contributor first
    distributes such Contribution.

2.3. Limitations on Grant Scope
    The licenses granted in this Section 2 by each Contributor do not apply
    to any:

    (a) "Greater Coverage" claim or claims that would be infringed by the
        use, sale, or offer for sale of that Contributor Version alone
        (without any other software or hardware not provided by the
        initial Contributor or any other Contributor); or

    (b) any claim that would be infringed only by a Modification of the
        Contributor Version by itself.

2.4. Subsequent Licenses
    No Contributor makes additional grants as a result of any choice You
    make to use the Covered Software under a subsequent version of this
